  OpenSSL 3: _internal/libcrypto-3.dll and _internal/libssl-3.dll are the
    CPython 3.12 runtime's own OpenSSL build, loaded by _ssl.pyd for every
    urllib HTTPS request OrbitRx makes (NOAA, HamQSL, PSKReporter, QRZ,
    ipinfo.io). _internal/libcrypto-3-x64.dll and _internal/libssl-3-x64.dll
    are a second copy, collected by PyInstaller's Qt hook for the Qt tls
    plugin qopensslbackend.dll. All four are OpenSSL 3, Apache License 2.0;
    the licence text ships at third_party/openssl/LICENSE.txt (also
    packaged as _internal/third_party/openssl/LICENSE.txt).
